Package: normanR
Title: Client for the 'Norman Network Database System' REST API
Version: 1.8.77
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Rafal", "Urniaz", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0192-2165"),
		  email = "rafal.urniaz@cantab.net", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Offers a programmatic interface to the NORMAN Network REST API,
    facilitating the systematic query, retrieval, and parsing of environmental
    chemistry data, emerging substance registries, and mass spectrometry workflows.
    All data structures are tailored to support downstream environmental data
    analysis and ecotoxicological modelling.
License: GPL-3
